// =====================================================================
// Energy and recycling: mitochondrion, ATP synthase, lysosome
// =====================================================================
// One mitochondrion, used both at its own level and (scaled down) in the whole-cell views.
// Two membranes; the cristae are hollow folds of the inner membrane, each joined to it
